Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 10:23:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] MERGE-e240a3f4: laptop packages 86-99 (GitHub main 736814b,
 GitLab main e240a3f4) into the machine tree

EastSun 20261001: integrate the laptop's new packages, and from now on whenever there are new ones.
Union of packages 86..99, 335 files: SAME 119, NEW 45, OLD 129 (laptop final), LOCAL 42.
- LOCAL 18 three-way merged (base = each package's own base), 10 clean; 20 conflict blocks in 8
  files resolved by hand:
  * MachineType.h: machine's W906_WEB_TOKEN_ENFORCE 0 block kept (TOKEN-OFF, EastSun 0928; the
    laptop does not take it). Net change to MachineType.h: none, so it is not in this commit.
  * WebBridge/WebBridgeServer.cpp: the laptop's dialog.notifyAck exemption + the machine's
    token-off holder logic (cfg.enforceControlToken).
  * JsonBridge/IoBtnPanelClick.cpp: the laptop's corrected note (h); the machine's IOWIDGET-3
    TestSuck Suck()/Destroy() sequence + W906_IoTestSuckTick (newer than the laptop).
  * tools/wb_serve.cpp (8): laptop notifyAck in the modal loop, A01 auto-logout tick, STREAM
    op-log sink, D012-A3W note, lstrcmpiA; machine IOWIDGET-3 TestSuck tick; the laptop's
    notifyAck command body only (its copy of HMI-KEEP / STOPBTN was byte-identical to the
    machine's existing one, so it is not duplicated).
  * cStateRecord.cpp: comments only. tests/CMakeLists.txt: the laptop's new test blocks.
- WebMotorAccessLive.cpp: the clean merge kept g_W906BrakeNote twice (both sides had added it
  a few lines apart) -> one, in the laptop's place. A scan of all 18 merges for lines that
  appear more often than on either side found no other case.
- tools/vscode-htdesigner/* (24 LOCAL) not taken: owned by the HTDESIGNER session, the machine
  copy is newer than the laptop's.
Behaviour changes from the packages (laptop README): pkg 87 the in-arm really picks from the
Loader tray (first START with someone by the machine); pkg 92 SystemInitialOK=true at boot
(panel keys / lamps / StopAllMotor in message boxes as golden); pkg 99 hot-plate mode places on
the hot plate after the pick. Not applied (machine config, EastSun decides): pkg 86's Mot_Table
M35/M36/M38-M40 Enable=0.
Verified: wb_serve builds in build_integ_ship_x86_o2 (0 errors); PE check 13/13 complete.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
